{'symbol': 'VTRS', 'date': '2023-05-09 05:45:00', 'title': 'VTRS NEWS: THE KLEIN LAW FIRM INITIATES AN INVESTIGATION INVOLVING POSSIBLE SECURITIES FRAUD VIOLATIONS BY OFFICERS OF VIATRIS INC.', 'text': 'NEW YORK , MAY 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KLEIN LAW FIRM ANNOUNCES THAT IT IS INVESTIGATING ALLEGATIONS THAT VIATRIS INC. ("VIATRIS" OR THE "COMPANY") (NASDAQGS: VTRS) VIOLATED FEDERAL SECURITIES LAWS. CURRENT INVESTIGATION DETAILS: BEFORE THE MARKET OPENED ON FEBRUARY 28, 2022, VIATRIS UNEXPECTEDLY ANNOUNCED THE COMPANY HAD ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT TO SELL ITS BIOSIMILARS BUSINESS TO BIOCON BIOLOGICS LIMITED, WHICH WAS ANTICIPATED TO CLOSE IN THE SECOND HALF OF 2022.'}